\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5789564\charrsid15223958 Zins in Fr\'fcchten.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid1474376\charrsid15223958 
